WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.671
Back in Steps, hold Shift and pad three for the closed hat. We're adding to the beat, keeping the kick and snare.

2
00:00:05.743 --> 00:00:11.054
Try eighth notes. Pads thirteen, fifteen, nine, and eleven fill the first half of the bar.

3
00:00:11.054 --> 00:00:16.771
Then pads five, seven, one, and three finish it. The last hit you entered is selected.

4
00:00:16.771 --> 00:00:23.845
With the Step knob page showing, turn Q one down. That last hat gets softer, which gives the loop a little movement.

5
00:00:23.845 --> 00:00:28.624
Play Start. Listen for the softer hit just before the bar comes round again.

6
00:00:28.624 --> 00:00:34.131
Stop, Undo, then Shift and Undo to bring it back. Keep the version that feels better to you.
